  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Senor** (1 review): Reviewer reads the song's introduction as a comment on the current situation in Venezuela [7]\n- **Watch It Fall** (1 review): Reviewer says this version's arrangement is more expanded and elaborated, making the first set worth hearing too [7]\n- **Dealing Despair** (1 review): Reviewer hears the song's closing as a bookend reflecting political division in America today [7]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pyramid**: rare: 7 archived performances [8]\n- **Space Is The Place**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [8]\n- **White Freightliner**: rare: 7 archived performances [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-03-07.420** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 117 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2019-03-07**: source not stated; 19 songs; 118 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [2]\n- **billystrings2019-03-07.mbho.ka500.at897**: source not stated; 19 songs; 118 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [3]. Said about its sound: Reviewer likes the blend of shotgun and hypercardioid mics; the hypers add pleasing low-end to the mix [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-03-07.420**: taped by Brain; transferred by Brain; source: AKG C568EB's & MBHO 603a (hyper cardioid capsules)> Sound Devices MixPre-6 (44.1 kHz 24 bit) [1]\n- **billystrings2019-03-07**: taped by DavidPuddy; transferred by DavidPuddy; source: AT 897 Shotguns PAS > MixPre 6 @ 24/48 [2]. Also: Recorded with AT897 shotgun mics, placed on a stand, into a MixPre 6 at 24-bit/48k; edited in Audacity, tracked in Reaper, FLAC, tagged in Foobar2000 [2]\n- **billystrings2019-03-07.mbho.ka500.at897**: taped by DavidPuddy; transferred by DavidPuddy; source: (1) MBHO KA500 Hypers DINa > Naiant PFA > MixPre 6 @ 24/48 (2) AT897 Shotguns PAS > MixPre 6 @ 24/48 [3]. Also: Chain: microSD, then Audacity (envelope, limiter, fades), Reaper (tracking, FLAC), Foobar2000 tagging, then upload to the Live Music Archive [3]",
